nto the allegations before we dismiss this as a mental break etc. The UN data checks out and it’s not a secret the US has bombed civilian targets indiscriminately. For decades NASA told us it was impossible to bring boosters back but in 2015 that was disproven - now it’s the standard. The science isn’t settled on anything, and it’s a fact that “new” tech released to the public has been used by government entities (ie DARPA) for at least 10 yrs prior to release. So is it possible there is working anti gravity tech? Absolutely. Did the SF soldier have info/witnessed something that was possibly covered up by the DOD? You bet your fourth point of contact. The quick dismissal by calling him mentally ill, having marital problems etc is a knee jerk reaction. I am in the wait and see camp and hope whomever investigates this gives this incident due diligence instead of the standard government CYA.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 1, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Sat Jan 04 01:19:02 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1875339879795847539', 'display_text_range': [14, 293], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '69156861', 'name': 'Chief Nerd', 'screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'indices': [0, 13]}]}, 'favorite_count': 20, 'favorited': False, 'full_text': '@TheChiefNerd If he actually wrote this, perhaps we should dig into the allegations before we dismiss this as a mental break etc. The UN data checks out and it’s not a secret the US has bombed civilian targets indiscriminately. For decades NASA told us it was impossible to bring boosters back', 'in_reply_to_screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'in_reply_to_status_id_str': '1875339879795847539', 'in_reply_to_user_id_str': '69156861', 'is_quote_status': False, 'lang': 'en', 'quote_count': 0, 'reply_count': 2, 'retweet_count': 2, 'retweeted': False, 'user_id_str': '538509838', 'id_str': '1